    "turn_text": "I wonder if that speaks to the heart of kind of the media narrative of tea party versus establishment. I know the media hypes that. And it's kind of come up after you got there. I'm curious, what are your thoughts on that? What is the real dichotomy between, quote unquote, tea party versus establishment of the public? And is there a difference? Do people see that?",
