    "turn_text": "I mean, curious, I mean, you talk about kind of the two mindsets and how there's a lot of similarity. How do you decide if you're going to vote for legislation or not? I mean, some of it's really easy. I believe in or this, I don't. But when you get some of these legally spending bills really long, there's some good, there's some bad. How do you make that decision?",
