    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90235.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "We have done a few things already. that are small in which people told me I could never get it done and I got it done. So let me give a shorter and a broader answer and I'll pick up too much time. I apologize.",
