    "turn_text": "Wonderful. Thank you. I love that question because I feel like most people are animated by one or two things really. There are a lot of things that we like to accomplish. But yeah, 435 minds in Congress all probably have one or two or three things that is really a focus. And so I want to help our audience see what it is that you really want to push for. My last question, Congressman, I really appreciate your time is, is there a misconception that the public doesn't see? Is there something, if you could tell the public, here's the one thing that you don't get that the media doesn't tell you about what's going on here? If I could give you one of those, what would that be?",
